tests/writing-instructions/NoForceWords.md:1:1:error:WritingInstructions.NoForceWords:§2: 'Consider' states no force. If the force is conditional, write a Conditional sentence. Otherwise, write a force word.
tests/writing-instructions/NoForceWords.md:3:1:error:WritingInstructions.NoForceWords:§2: 'If needed' states no force. If the force is conditional, write a Conditional sentence. Otherwise, write a force word.
tests/writing-instructions/NoForceWords.md:11:20:error:WritingInstructions.NoForceWords:§2: 'if necessary' states no force. If the force is conditional, write a Conditional sentence. Otherwise, write a force word.
tests/writing-instructions/NoForceWords.md:11:20:suggestion:WritingInstructions.ConditionLast:§1: the condition follows the action. Write 'If C, do X', not 'Do X if C'.
